{
  "version": "0.4.0-alpha.6",
  "notes": "## 0.4.0-alpha.6 - 2026-04-08\n\n### Features\n\n- Add zoom in and zoom out shortcuts, with interface scale that persists and stays consistent across the main window and quick panel.\n- Add file-list preview support so copied files show readable filenames in the quick panel.\n- Improve cross-device connection behavior to prefer faster local routes first and reduce failed sync attempts.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix pairing flows that could get stuck after a finished or failed session and block new pairing requests.\n- Fix Windows startup cases where global shortcuts could fail to register and prevent normal launch.\n- Fix browser-based delete actions so clipboard items can be removed reliably in web deployments.\n- Reduce lag when previewing very large text content.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.4.0-alpha.6 - 2026-04-08\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增缩放快捷键，界面缩放比例可持久保存，并在主窗口与快速面板之间保持一致。\n- 新增文件列表预览，复制文件后可在快速面板直接看到可读文件名。\n- 优化跨设备连接行为，优先使用更快的本地连接路径，并减少同步连接失败。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复配对会话结束或失败后可能卡住并阻塞新配对请求的问题。\n- 修复 Windows 启动时全局快捷键注册失败导致应用无法正常启动的情况。\n- 修复 Web 部署中浏览器删除剪贴板条目可能失败的问题。\n- 缓解预览超大文本内容时的卡顿问题。",
